+|---:|---|
+| `1 <= i <= t` | `<1>` |
+| `t < i <= 2t` | `<1,A>` |
+| `2t < i <= 3t` | `<1,A,B>` |
+| `i=3t+1` | `<1,gamma,A,B,z>` |
