+```text
+ord C_i >= -i/e = -i/(3t+1).
+```
+
+### 1.2 Spaces, generator, and gauges
+
+**DERIVED.** With
+
+```text
+z=pi-gamma,
+B=pi*z+b1*pi+b2,
+A=pi*B+b3,
+h=pi*A+b4,
